<ContentPage
  title="Karinderya Stoves"
  description="Browse Karinderya Stoves and learn how cooking equipment fits into the kitchen and restaurant workflow."
  kicker="Equipment directory"
  intro="Browse the Stove directory and connect each cooking-equipment entry with the wider restaurant workflow."
  parent={{ label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }}
  heroImage={siteImages.equipmentHero}
  tableOfContents
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Equipment Hub', href: '/equipment/', description: 'Browse restaurant equipment categories and related guides.' },
    { label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/', description: 'Follow the restaurant workflow from preparation through customer service.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the main restaurant systems and navigation paths.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="introduction">Introduction</h2>
  <p>Stoves are grouped together in the Equipment section because they support the cooking part of restaurant service. This page acts as the directory for the Stove entries currently covered by the Wiki.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The Stove directory keeps individual equipment articles separate from broader kitchen guidance. Open an entry for information about that named Stove, or use the related guides to follow the complete preparation and serving workflow.</p>

  <h2 id="how-equipment-works">How Equipment Works</h2>
  <p>Cooking equipment connects the kitchen with the rest of restaurant service. Ingredients and recipes provide preparation context, while the cooking and serving guide explains how kitchen tasks continue into customer service.</p>

  <h2 id="directory">Directory</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <WikiCard title="Basic Stove" description="Open the Basic Stove equipment entry." href="/equipment/basic-stove/" icon="B" />
    <WikiCard title="Standard Stove" description="Open the Standard Stove equipment entry." href="/equipment/standard-stove/" icon="S" />
    <WikiCard title="Deluxe Stove" description="Open the Deluxe Stove equipment entry." href="/equipment/deluxe-stove/" icon="D" />
  </div>

  <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
  <p>Use this directory to identify a Stove by name and open its dedicated article. For broader kitchen planning, continue to the Equipment Hub or Cooking and Serving Guide.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep the cooking area connected with the ingredient and serving parts of the restaurant workflow.</li>
    <li>Use the individual Stove entries when you need focused information about a named piece of equipment.</li>
    <li>Review the complete service flow before changing how kitchen work areas are organized.</li>
  </ul>
</ContentPage>
